i running from s plus 1

511
00:35:23,540 --> 00:35:27,420
to N, dVi.

512
00:35:27,420 --> 00:35:30,640
Now the rho comes outside.

513
00:35:30,640 --> 00:35:34,840
And the derivative acts on
