681
00:47:15,820 --> 00:47:20,510
This is the rho that
corresponds to the joint.

682
00:47:20,510 --> 00:47:24,950
But I had here s
plus 1 integrations.

683
00:47:24,950 --> 00:47:27,860
One of them I wrote
