693
00:48:05,160 --> 00:48:13,130
is that if I take the time
variation of an s particle

694
00:48:13,130 --> 00:48:21,380
density, I will get one
term that I expected,

695
00:48:21,380 --> 00:48:26,060
which is if those s particles
